# recursive interpolation not allowed

Huaputa tuhi: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Papatono āhuatanga: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), rārangi-hou.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Huaputa tuhi: a, rārangi-hou.


Papatono āhuatanga: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] whakahohe: Pono.

